OL,3,GNEWSAParliament date set for 'summer of
OL,4,Asex' debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Derbyshire MP has been given a date
OL,7,Ffor a House of Commons debate following
OL,8,Fher campaign calling for lifelong sex
OL,9,Feducation.
OL,11,FDubbed the "summer of sex", the
OL,12,Fcampaign was launched to push education
OL,13,Fabout consent, respect and healthy
OL,14,Frelationships, with the aim of
OL,15,Fpreventing abuse and violence, but has
OL,16,Freceived a mixed response in
OL,17,FWestminster.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
