OL,3,GNEWSAParliament date set for 'summer of
OL,4,Asex' debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FNiblett has previously said she also
OL,7,Fplans a separate event to display a
OL,8,Fnumber of sex toys and sex education
OL,9,Faids in Parliament as part of the
OL,10,Fcampaign. However this is unlikely to
OL,11,Ftake place until the New Year.
OL,13,FThe backbench debate is due to take
OL,14,Fplace in Parliament on 26 November, it
OL,15,Fhas been confirmed.
